<mujoco model="weeds">

    <!--
      The weeds, included by scene_mobile_field.xml (mesh paths resolve from there).

      Each weed is a free body welded to the soil; weed_extraction.env cuts the weld
      once the pull passes ROOT_BREAK_FORCE. The bottom 4 cm is one rigid link, so the
      gripper always has something solid to hold; above it the stalk is 3 links on
      sprung hinges, which bend away when the arm brushes them and spring back.

      The pretty mesh never collides: MuJoCo would replace it with a convex hull
      20-70 mm wide where the real stem is 1-2.5 mm. Collision comes from the convex
      decomposition instead, each piece parented to the segment it sits in.
    -->

